{
  "name": "Photo Analysis",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "id": "every-2-hours",
      "name": "Every 2 Hours"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "search",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $env.AIRTABLE_BASE_ID }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Leads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "filterByFormula": "=AND({Photo URL} != '', {Photo Analysis} = '', NOT({Status} = 'Dead'))",
        "options": {
          "maxRecords": 10
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300],
      "id": "get-leads-with-photos",
      "name": "Get Leads with Photos (No Analysis)",
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "airtable-creds",
          "name": "Airtable"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-leads",
              "leftValue": "={{ $input.all().length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [680, 300],
      "id": "has-leads",
      "name": "Has Leads?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [900, 260],
      "id": "loop-leads",
      "name": "Loop Leads"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"image_url\",\n          \"image_url\": {\n            \"url\": \"{{ $json.fields['Photo URL'] }}\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"Analyze this property photo for a real estate investor. Assess the property's condition and potential for wholesale/flip opportunity.\\n\\nProperty Context:\\n- Address: {{ $json.fields.Address }}, {{ $json.fields.City }}\\n- Listed Price: ${{ $json.fields['Asking Price'] || 'Unknown' }}\\n- Source: {{ $json.fields.Source }}\\n\\nAnalyze and provide:\\n\\n1. **Condition Score (1-10)**: Overall property condition\\n2. **Curb Appeal Score (1-10)**: First impression/exterior appeal\\n3. **Visible Issues**: List any visible problems (roof, siding, windows, foundation, landscaping, etc.)\\n4. **Estimated Repair Categories**: \\n   - Cosmetic only (paint, landscaping) = $5-15k\\n   - Minor repairs = $15-30k  \\n   - Moderate rehab = $30-60k\\n   - Major rehab = $60-100k+\\n5. **Flip Potential**: Low/Medium/High based on visible condition\\n6. **Red Flags**: Any major concerns (structural, water damage, etc.)\\n7. **Positive Features**: Any notable positives\\n\\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\\n{\\n  \\\"condition_score\\\": 7,\\n  \\\"curb_appeal_score\\\": 6,\\n  \\\"visible_issues\\\": [\\\"issue1\\\", \\\"issue2\\\"],\\n  \\\"repair_estimate_category\\\": \\\"Minor repairs\\\",\\n  \\\"repair_estimate_range\\\": \\\"$15-30k\\\",\\n  \\\"flip_potential\\\": \\\"Medium\\\",\\n  \\\"red_flags\\\": [\\\"flag1\\\"] or [],\\n  \\\"positive_features\\\": [\\\"feature1\\\", \\\"feature2\\\"],\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"1-2 sentence overall assessment\\\"\\n}\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"max_tokens\": 800,\n  \"temperature\": 0.3\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1120, 260],
      "id": "analyze-photo",
      "name": "AI Photo Analysis",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "openrouter-auth",
          "name": "OpenRouter"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse AI photo analysis\nconst aiResponse = $input.first().json;\nconst lead = $('Loop Leads').item.json;\n\nlet analysis = {\n  condition_score: 5,\n  curb_appeal_score: 5,\n  visible_issues: ['Unable to analyze'],\n  repair_estimate_category: 'Unknown',\n  repair_estimate_range: 'Unknown',\n  flip_potential: 'Unknown',\n  red_flags: [],\n  positive_features: [],\n  summary: 'Photo analysis failed'\n};\n\ntry {\n  const content = aiResponse.choices[0].message.content;\n  const jsonMatch = content.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  if (jsonMatch) {\n    analysis = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]);\n  }\n} catch (e) {\n  // Use defaults\n}\n\n// Calculate investment score adjustment based on condition\nlet scoreAdjustment = 0;\nif (analysis.condition_score <= 4) scoreAdjustment = 10; // Distressed = opportunity\nif (analysis.condition_score >= 8) scoreAdjustment = -5; // Too nice = less margin\nif (analysis.flip_potential === 'High') scoreAdjustment += 5;\nif (analysis.red_flags.length > 2) scoreAdjustment -= 10;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    lead: lead,\n    analysis: analysis,\n    scoreAdjustment: scoreAdjustment\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1340, 260],
      "id": "parse-analysis",
      "name": "Parse Analysis"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $env.AIRTABLE_BASE_ID }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Leads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "id": "={{ $json.lead.id }}",
        "fields": {
          "fieldMapping": [
            {
              "fieldName": "Photo Analysis",
              "fieldValue": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.analysis) }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "Condition Score",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.analysis.condition_score }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "Repair Estimate",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.analysis.repair_estimate_range }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "AI Score",
              "fieldValue": "={{ Math.min(100, Math.max(0, ($json.lead.fields['AI Score'] || 50) + $json.scoreAdjustment)) }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1560, 260],
      "id": "update-lead",
      "name": "Update Lead with Analysis",
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "airtable-creds",
          "name": "Airtable"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "high-potential",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.flip_potential }}",
              "rightValue": "High",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "distressed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.condition_score }}",
              "rightValue": 5,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "lte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1780, 260],
      "id": "is-opportunity",
      "name": "High Flip Potential?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "#opportunities",
        "text": "=:camera: *Photo Analysis Complete - Potential Opportunity!*\n\n*Property:* {{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.lead.fields.Address }}, {{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.lead.fields.City }}\n*Listed:* ${{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.lead.fields['Asking Price'] || 'N/A' }}\n\n*Condition Scores:*\n• Overall: {{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.condition_score }}/10\n• Curb Appeal: {{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.curb_appeal_score }}/10\n\n*Repair Estimate:* {{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.repair_estimate_range }}\n*Flip Potential:* {{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.flip_potential }}\n\n*Visible Issues:*\n{{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.visible_issues.map(i => '• ' + i).join('\\n') }}\n\n{{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.red_flags.length > 0 ? '*Red Flags:*\\n' + $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.red_flags.map(f => '🚩 ' + f).join('\\n') : '' }}\n\n*Summary:* {{ $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis.summary }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [2000, 220],
      "id": "slack-alert",
      "name": "Slack Opportunity Alert",
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "slack-creds",
          "name": "Slack"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 5,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [2220, 260],
      "id": "rate-limit",
      "name": "Rate Limit (5s)",
      "webhookId": "photo-rate-limit"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 380],
      "id": "no-leads",
